01:12:28,590 --> 01:22:42,010
Then the children were going along playing. They were going along playing. And suddenly the eye of some fell on a vast mountain. A new one. The children had not yet wandered everywhere. So they did not come to know whether this is some new mountain, or this is, that is. Check it. It is some beauty of Vrindavan. It is the beauty of nature. Seeing it, in that form, all accepted this, that this is a special natural beauty of Vrindavan. This is a mountain. It is a road. A forest fire is burning. These are the great peaks of the mountain. All understood this. And the newness felt greatly attractive to them. Such a mountain, such a road, such a road. And now seeing this, their wish came to enter inside it. What he wanted, this is what the people did. The children, the beauty of Vrindavan. They began to take it as a beauty of Vrindavan. The open mouth of the python is not for our sake. Looking with a playful feeling. Then like the beak, the mouth, of a python, it was spread. A mountain. They are thinking this. A poetic fancy. They look. The meaning of looking is to guess, to say. What thing is this, friends. What thing is it. Look, look, look. O friends, speak. These friends, just speak. See what it is like. The meaning of speak is to speak. Speak, speak, what has come. How beautiful it is looking. As if some living being, having changed country, is hidden. The mountain is made in such a way that it is looking like a living being. And is it not looking like this, that for swallowing us it is like a python. It has spread the mouth. Then it is a python itself. But these people are looking. For swallowing us, is this like the mouth of a python or not. Then all the children say, this nature is like the mouth of a python. A famous thing. Fear is not happening. Because they know that this is a mountain. It is stone. It is a natural beauty of Vrindavan. This python is sitting to swallow us. It is looking like that. Then all look with attention. Yes, you say rightly. It is looking exactly like a python. But it is not a python. It is a mountain. This is, that is. They say so. And all the children say, yes, yes, exactly a python. Yes, it completely seems. But it is a mountain. All say this. Is this open mouth of a serpent, opened to swallow and not finished, not so. Is it not looking like the mouth of a serpent. Mouth means the mouth. And spread, opened, the opened mouth of a python, it is looking like that. Yes, just so. Look, this which is shaded by a cloud above, it is looking red. That is the upper lip. It was the upper jaw of the snake. That was the upper one. But people say, look, the cloud shaded above, on the mountain, is looking red. This is looking so because of the rays of the sun. It is red. Look here. And this is looking red, so it is looking as if it is the jaw of a serpent. It is the upper lip. But it is a cloud. These clouds. The cloud has become red because of the rays of the sun. True. When some child, which children, said, O friends, look, is this looking like the mouth of a python or not. Then the others say, true. You are speaking the truth. Reddened by the rays of the sun. This sun. It is looking like the raised upper lip of a python. Like the lower jaw, the place of the cliff, the reflected redness. And below, the cliffs of the mountain. Below, the part of the mountain. It is looking like the lower lip of a python. All say, yes, yes, yes, right. And this redness from above. Striking, the redness is coming here also. And all together, because of the rays of the sun, all the mountain peaks are looking red. But it is looking exactly equal to a python. As if rivaling the corners of the mouth. Attention, friends, friends. In the belly of the mountain. Look, in the belly of the mountain, these which are on both sides, left and right, the parts of the mountain. Are these not looking equal to the corners of a serpent's mouth, equal to the jaws. Equal to the jaws of a serpent, both edges. They say the corners of the mouth. These are the belly of the mountain. They are the belly of the mountain. But are they not rivaling the corners of a serpent's mouth. That is, are they looking like the jaws of a serpent or not. Then the others say, yes, yes, you speak the complete truth. And look, high, high. There are the rows of his teeth. Equal to great mountain peaks. Then they say, the rows of the high peaks of the mountain. The peaks are spread. The row is spread. And rested on. The tongue like a path is roaring against it. And look at this, this road that has come out. It is a path. This is looking like the tongue of a python. He is understanding everything in the form of a python. But this feeling has stayed, yes, this is a mountain. Rested, or the tongue like a path is roaring against it. This, the darkness gone into the cave. This spread one, this wide road, is looking like the tongue of a python. And this darkness that is being seen, vast. This is looking like the darkness that is inside the throat of a python. It is looking like that. This mountain cave, the darkness that is in this cave, is looking like the darkness of the mouth of a python. This hot wind of a forest fire is seeming like breath. And this hot wind that is coming. Somewhere a fire is burning. Living beings are burning in it. So a burnt smell is coming. The smell of a corpse burning, and the smell of a body burning, is coming. He has eaten. From the belly a burnt, smelling wind is coming of his. And hot. Aghasura's belly stayed so hot that as a fire burns outside, and if a straw falls in it, the straw burns. In the same way the children were going to burn in it. So a very hot wind was coming, and a bad-smelling wind was coming. So that is what they say, this hot wind of a forest fire is seeming like breath. This wind that is coming from a forest fire catching. Is this not looking like the breath-wind of a python. A python also eats, so a bad smell comes out of his mouth. In the same way this forest fire has caught. So this has come out like the breath-wind of a python. That bad smell of the creatures, and also like the smell of flesh inside. This smell of flesh is coming. The living beings burning in the forest fire, their smell is coming in the same way as a python, having eaten some animal. And that is the smell of flesh. So in truth the smell of flesh is coming. These. Seeing, they say this, either it is a mountain, or it is, that is.

