01:22:47,350 --> 01:25:47,730
But some had a doubt. Then, is this a python. Belief was not happening. Saying it just so. Then, is it a python. And is it lying to swallow us. If it will want to swallow, then like Baka. Just now Bakasura died. In the same way this one also will go. He is making this courage. Bakasura also showed like a mountain peak. They were thinking, this is the beauty of Vrindavan. In truth there is no python. But they were going along saying, if it makes the effort to swallow us, then by this one. By him, in a moment, it will be destroyed. Saying in this way, and looking at the face of Bakari. Then, looking at Krishna's face. Krishna was standing somewhat aside. Looking at him. And clapping. Come, come. Come, come. Let us enter. Whoever clapped, then the calves. All the boys began to laugh. He clapped, then with more force they ran and went into the mouth. The calves went first. They fled. And behind them these now ran. But they were going, looking at Krishna's face. Bakari. Looking at his face. Its meaning is not of that one. Looking at Krishna's supremely beautiful face, laughing, clapping, enter. Their feeling was, come, come, Krishna, let us go. Let us see this one beauty. Let us do this, let us do that. It is a very beautiful beauty. And the red road is going on. As far as it goes, let us go that far. Then he was lying with the tongue out.

